{"id": 988192, "slug": "kamikaze-lassplanes", "name": "Kamikaze Lassplanes", "name_original": "Kamikaze Lassplanes", "description": "Kamikaze Lassplanes is a brand new mix of Visual Novel and SHMUP with crucial story-branching decisions that lead to different gameplay and story outcomes, both for war, romance, and the protagonists’ fate.<br/><br/><br/><br/>Meet and fall for <strong>Alba Trossé</strong> and <strong>Hannah Brandenburg</strong> - charismatic Lassplanes who transform into deadly war planes you pilot. Face the Imperial fleet together in challenging arcade shoot-'em-up encounters and discover the secret behind their mysterious origin.<br/><br/><strong>But will the gift prove to be a curse?</strong><br/><br/><br/><br/>Dive into an engaging, dark story about exploring humanity in a world where every rose has its thorn, and every tool can become a weapon. When nothing is as it seems, your beliefs are shattered as you uncover the truth—and perhaps you’ll pay the ultimate price for it.<br/><br/><strong>Decide the fate of your kingdom and your heart.</strong><br/><br/><br/><br/><br/><br/><strong>Your choices matter:</strong><br/><ul><li>Unlock various endings that will reveal different faces of Alba and Hannah. <br/></li><li>Discover and collect a gallery of beautiful, hand-drawn ecchi illustrations. <br/></li><li>Challenge yourself in Arcade mode and beat records. <br/></li><li>Control the lethal Lassplanes in various missions set in a fully 3D environment.</li></ul>", "metacritic": null, "metacritic_platforms": [], "released": "2024-08-29", "tba": false, "updated": "2026-08-18T12:46:03", "background_image": "https://media.rawg.io/media/screenshots/cb7/cb75606adb6867bb8e861eaa57e78f29.jpg", "background_image_additional": "https://media.rawg.io/media/screenshots/a6e/a6e169edf9138f0e67f50b641ce201f0.jpg", "website": "https://kamikazelassplanes.com", "rating": 0.0, "rating_top": 0, "ratings": [{"id": 3, "title": "meh", "count": 1, "percent": 100.0}], "reactions":